  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ExtremeBreakColor>极端崩溃颜色</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ExtremeBreakColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MajorBreakColor>严重崩溃颜色</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MajorBreakColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MinorBreakColor>轻微崩溃颜色</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MinorBreakColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.NeutralColor>中性心情颜色</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.NeutralColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ContentColor>满足颜色</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ContentColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.HappyColor>快乐颜色</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.HappyColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IncludeBreakBox>崩溃风险框</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IncludeBreakBox>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IncludeBreakBoxDesc>如果殖民者有精神崩溃风险，在其肖像周围添加彩色边框。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IncludeBreakBoxDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BreakBoxOnTop>边框置顶</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BreakBoxOnTop>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BreakBoxOnTopDesc>将崩溃风险框显示在殖民者肖像上方，以便更好地查看。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BreakBoxOnTopDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.NeutralBreakBox>中性心情时显示边框</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.NeutralBreakBox>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.NeutralBreakBoxDesc>即使殖民者当前心情中性，也显示崩溃风险框。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.NeutralBreakBoxDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ScheduleBox>日程指示器</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ScheduleBox>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ScheduleBoxDesc>在心情条上显示与殖民者当前日程对应的轮廓。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ScheduleBoxDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IllnessIcon>疾病图标</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IllnessIcon>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IllnessIconDesc>当殖民者需要产生免疫力时显示状态图标：
■ 红色——感染领先于免疫力
■ 黄色——免疫力领先感染不足 5%
■ 绿色——免疫力领先感染超过 5%</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.IllnessIconDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BleedingIcon>流血图标</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BleedingIcon>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BleedingIconDesc>如果殖民者在流血，则显示图标。大小取决于失血速度。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.BleedingIconDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.AltLabel>替代标签（实验性）</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.AltLabel>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.AltLabelDesc>使用更高效但实验性的殖民者姓名绘制方法。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.AltLabelDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ForcePortrait>征召时刷新肖像</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ForcePortrait>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ForcePortraitDesc>在殖民者被征召或取消征召时强制刷新肖像。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ForcePortraitDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.CryptoIcon>休眠舱图标</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.CryptoIcon>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.CryptoIconDesc>如果殖民者在休眠舱中，则显示图标。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.CryptoIconDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RelationIcon>关系图标</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RelationIcon>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RelationIconDesc>显示恋爱关系图标（爱心）。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RelationIconDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ShowGender>显示性别</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ShowGender>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ShowGenderDesc>在心情条上显示性别图标。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ShowGenderDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MaleColor>颜色（男性）</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MaleColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.FemaleColor>颜色（女性）</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.FemaleColor>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ThermalIcon>温度指示器</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ThermalIcon>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ThermalIconDesc>在失温或中暑时显示图标。颜色可在下方设置。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.ThermalIconDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MinorHot>颜色（轻度过热）</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MinorHot>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.SeriousHot>颜色（严重过热）</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.SeriousHot>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MinorCold>颜色（轻度失温）</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.MinorCold>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.SeriousCold>颜色（严重失温）</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.SeriousCold>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.DisplayWeapons>显示武器</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.DisplayWeapons>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.DisplayWeaponsDesc>启用显示殖民者武器图标。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.DisplayWeaponsDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowMode>武器显示模式</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowMode>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowModeDesc>选择：始终显示武器，或仅在殖民者被征召（Drafted）时显示。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowModeDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponPlacementOffset>武器位置偏移</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponPlacementOffset>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponPlacementOffsetDesc>调整武器图标的垂直位置。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponPlacementOffsetDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowScale>武器大小</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowScale>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowScaleDesc>武器图标的缩放。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.WeaponShowScaleDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.PortraitMode>肖像模式</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.PortraitMode>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.PortraitModeDesc>为优化性能而隐藏肖像：
◆ 显示全部——显示所有殖民者。
◆ 隐藏全部——隐藏整个顶部栏。
◆ 仅当前地图——仅当前地图上的殖民者。
◆ 仅屏幕内——仅屏幕上可见的殖民者。
◆ 仅崩溃风险——隐藏状态良好的人。
◆ 仅问题人物——隐藏健康或心情有问题的人。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.PortraitModeDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.HidingMode>隐藏规则</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.HidingMode>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.HidingModeDesc>隐藏时保留什么：
完全隐藏 = 移除整个元素。
仅姓名 = 只保留姓名文本。
姓名和边框 = 姓名和轮廓（无面孔和图标）。
姓名、边框和肖像 = 除心情条和图标外的全部。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.HidingModeDesc>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RefreshRate>刷新频率：</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RefreshRate>
  <CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RefreshRateDesc>数据刷新间隔（值越大 FPS 越高，但状态更新延迟越大）。</CmColoredMoodBarPatch.RefreshRateDesc>
